  "notes": "Keep passive USB navigation from starting cartridge probes or the BIOS fan/date sync. Cancel queued checks during the lease and suppress automatic startup replay after CLOSE while preserving ordinary local checks and diagnostic output ownership.\n\nValidation: nine focused host suites, fresh independent reviews, checked build and USB install. A 215.75-second live pass completed 22 routes plus three nested pages and curtain motion; all 4,242 sampled actuator statuses were zero. Twenty-five frame CRCs match, EASTER-to-TENIS entry and service exit are verified, flashlight learning is preserved, and BLE/Twin returned.\n\nThe connected-fixture NTC/cooler findings and intermittent IR investigation remain open; this release does not hide their faults or claim full hardware/FPS acceptance. Error-overlay blue-channel attribution is separately under investigation.\n",
